{
  "server": "tw",
  "storyId": "act13d5_level_act13d5_03_end",
  "groupId": "act13d5",
  "stageId": "act13d5_03",
  "title": "玫瑰報業",
  "storyCode": "MN-3",
  "avgTag": "行動後",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsData/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act13d5/level_act13d5_03_end.txt",
  "sourceHash": "297d3e69c757e484ef24a75b36f4f8a208cb3d867e032b16fb5dd56e87fa47f5",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "卡西米尔 3下"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "瑪莉婭。\n瑪莉婭，你有一雙天馬的眼睛。\n瑪莉婭，站起來，來，過來。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呃！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "哈......哈......！居然躲開了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "那好吧，就讓你的右手在你的身上多待一會......反正就一小會。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（——不是眼淚，黏糊糊的，是血？）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（......好多血......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（心跳好快......我......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "滑稽，真滑稽，你揮舞武器的樣子就像大騎士團門前的那些弄臣......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "除了外貌，你有哪點像那個耀騎士了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我......我是不會輸的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "好啊，這樣我更樂意撕碎你那張臉了，不識好歹的貴族妞！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "英格拉！風暴般的追擊！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "這是本次賽事以來，呼嘯競技場最誇張的一次損毀——！賽場屠夫英格拉！“鏽銅”英格拉！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "就在一個月前，“鏽銅”英格拉在本賽季的首秀就將“焚風”騎士毆打致四肢粉碎性骨折才肯甘休！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "沒錯，是毆打！這絕非手持武器的騎士行徑！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "今天，在呼嘯競技場備受矚目的瑪莉婭·臨光，是否也難逃“鏽銅”殘暴的利斧？觀眾們，告訴我你們的態度！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "就是這樣！“鏽銅”英格拉！讓你的對手血濺當場吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呼啊......哈啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（好重——）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭！投降吧！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "只是輸掉一場比賽而已！積分還是有機會的——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭——！！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "佐菲婭姑母......在說什麼？\n聽不清......頭好暈......盾也好重......\n我......在做什麼......騎士競技......我在賽場上......\n快......睜開眼！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "呼啊......呼啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "哈！不錯的反擊——這才有撕裂你的意義！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "那麼快就完蛋可沒意思了，我要用你的血，塗滿你那張讓人火大的臉......耀騎士！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "你明明......也快到極限了吧？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "哈，這點血也能叫傷！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯......英格拉提前出戰了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "國民院提前釋放了他，嘁，這審判根本就形同虛設。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "看來集團為他掏了不少錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "嗯哼......玫瑰報業聯合集團有的是錢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "還真讓人火大，人渣和輿論反倒能帶來利潤，那個解說員甚至敢在公開賽事拿這種事來說。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "因為他們不怕。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "是呀，怕啥呢。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "怕我們，英格拉不喜歡失敗，而我會讓他一敗塗地。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "別呀，說好的讓我上呢？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "text": "不過在那之前......如果小臨光還不想想辦法，她會傷得很重的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "——血肉橫飛的場景遲遲沒有到來！瑪莉婭·臨光，比想像中還要頑強的少女！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "還在等什麼，難道這樣的騎士不讓人心生敬仰嗎！？別忘了！本賽季的敬仰手續費只需要百分之五十！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "——等等！情況又有變化！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "對峙著的二人——瑪莉婭竟然捨棄了盾牌！發生了什麼！？難道她想靠那把脆弱的單手劍接下英格拉的巨斧！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "巨大的體格差，巨大的力量差，只是靠著靈活的身手勉強躲避的瑪莉婭，終於準備正面對決了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "大嘴莫布",
      "text": "容我再強調一遍——！本賽季的手續費只有一半！這樣勇敢的行徑難道不值幾十枚金幣嗎！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "哈啊......哈啊......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "......做的，還不賴，你這小妞......淡淡的光覆蓋在劍刃上，這是你最後的手段嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "鏽銅騎士",
      "text": "哈，好啊！我會撕下你的手臂，然後用你的血肉塞住你的喉嚨——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "必須獲勝......必須......\n我在做什麼來著......騎士競技，需要殺死對手嗎？\n盾，不需要......我擋不住他的重斧......\n但他也受傷了，他不在乎......他像個怪物，他殺伐取樂......\n我......該怎麼面對這樣的敵人......敵人？他不是騎士嗎？\n騎士......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "“所謂騎士，就是照亮整片大地的崇高者。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊——！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "疼、疼疼疼......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......醒了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "姑母......？我怎麼......啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "想起來了？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......我輸了嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "嗯。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "但是英格拉也倒下了，你們兩個人的積分都沒有變化。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "是、是這樣，呼......那就好——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "根本就不好！你受了傷！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "面對那樣的對手，你應該棄權的，瑪莉婭，只是放棄一場比賽，積分還可以再想辦法追回來！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "如果只是想要贏得封號保住貴族之名，何必要這麼——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我......我沒想過要棄權。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "雖然萬幸沒有傷筋動骨......對手是英格拉還能全身而退，真的算你運氣好了！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "如果你再受傷，就算能夠進入特錦賽又怎麼樣！？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......他很厲害，但是......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "很不像騎士。他的家族本來就家大業大，參賽也只是來享受施暴樂趣的，奧爾默·英格拉就是這樣的人。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "瑪莉婭，你如果再受這樣的傷，我不允許你繼續參賽了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我——",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "聽姐姐的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "我......我知道了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "別亂動，好好休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "雖然是平手，但是接下來找到你的企業合作會越來越多......我和馬丁叔會暫時幫你謝絕一些，你必須安心養傷。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "啊......那把劍是？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "......是我以前的佩劍。上次訓練的時候把它翻出來了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "為什麼佐菲婭姐姐要特地帶著這把劍......？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "（姑母明明已經......）",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "沒什麼特別的理由。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "只是萬一英格拉真的對你做了些什麼，哪怕事後要面對國民院，我也會親手殺了他。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "不、不用考慮到這一步啦......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "......能給我看看嗎？好像已經很久沒用了。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不行，好好休息。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "光待在床上會生鏽的啦……",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "不行。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "佐菲婭姐姐，姑母，就這一個要求，我會乖乖待在家裡休息的！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "你......唉，越來越像你姐姐了......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "給你吧，別對它做什麼奇怪的事情，我還是挺愛惜的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "瑪莉婭",
      "text": "欸......這不是挺多灰的嘛......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "佐菲婭",
      "text": "灰塵才是愛惜的證明！",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "你們大包小包的是要去哪裡？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "去探望一下瑪莉婭。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "英格拉那個混蛋，對丫頭下那麼重的手......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "我倒覺得你們別去打擾她們比較好，佐菲婭會照顧好瑪莉婭的。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老工匠",
      "text": "我坐不住啊！你看到英格拉最後那一斧了嗎？萬一留下什麼後遺症怎麼辦？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "一個老騎士和一個老工匠，總是能幫上忙的......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "那遇上瑪恩納怎麼辦？就不怕他一手一個把你們拎出去？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老騎士",
      "text": "......那臭小子，臨光老爺在的時候哪敢這麼放肆，打不過還躲不起嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "......唔，那兩個老頭剛走就有新客人了，看來他們是我的煞星啊。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "光頭馬丁",
      "text": "酒吧可好久沒來過這麼可愛的客人了啊，需要點什麼嗎？",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "嗯......",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "白金",
      "text": "......這名字挺好聽的，就這個吧，“荊棘淚珠”。",
      "portraitKey": null
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ]
}
